.TH CANDLE 1 "candle" ""
.SH NAME
candle \- GRBL controller application with G-Code visualizer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "candle"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I candle
is a Qt-based application for controlling GRBL devices such as
laser cutters, routers, 3d printers.
.SH COMMAND LINE OPTIONS
.I candle
takes no command line options.
